sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Health worker
    participant FE as React app (ApiClient)
    participant API as FastAPI POST /predict
    participant AUTH as AuthService + TokenService
    participant SS as ScreeningService
    participant IV as ImageValidator
    participant CL as EfficientNetClassifier
    participant RP as ReviewPolicy
    participant GC as GradCamExplainer
    participant ST as ImageStore
    participant DB as CaseRepository (SQL)

    U->>FE: choose or take a photo, press Analyse
    FE->>API: multipart image + Bearer JWT
    API->>AUTH: verify token, load user
    AUTH-->>API: user (or 401)
    API->>SS: screen(user, content type, bytes)
    SS->>IV: validate
    alt photo fails a check
        IV-->>SS: ImageRejected (415 / 413 / 400 / 422)
        SS-->>FE: {"detail": clear message}
        FE-->>U: error box, no result
    else photo accepted
        IV-->>SS: PIL image
        SS->>CL: predict(image)
        Note over CL: resize to 300x300, ImageNet normalisation<br/>backbone once, classifier head 10x with dropout on<br/>average softmax, entropy = -sum p log p
        CL-->>SS: 7 probabilities, entropy, top class
        SS->>GC: explain(image, top class)
        Note over GC: Grad-CAM on features[-1]
        GC-->>SS: heatmap PNG
        SS->>RP: decide(probabilities, entropy)
        Note over RP: review if entropy >= threshold<br/>OR P(melanoma) >= 0.05
        RP-->>SS: review flag + reason
        SS->>ST: save photo and heatmap
        SS->>DB: insert case, classification_result, explainability_map
        SS-->>API: ScreeningResult
        API-->>FE: JSON: class, probabilities, entropy, threshold,<br/>review flag, heatmap, model version, disclaimer, time
        FE-->>U: result card, uncertainty meter, banner, heatmap
    end
